\newlabel{tab:cross_logic_compare}{{13}{8}{Prolog vs.\ FOL STA cross-logic comparison. With 1/3 seeds failing entirely and massive variance, Prolog results do not constitute evidence for cross-logic generalization of the Goodhart pattern}{table.13}{}}
